# Normalize line endings on checkin. Windows contributors save with CRLF by
# default, and without this git records the whole file as rewritten: #555
# arrived as a 2159-line diff for ~75 lines of real work, and would have
# landed three files with line endings unlike the rest of the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.zstd binary
